  "description": "Add a breezy summer touch to your designs with this pastel diagonal stripe seamless pattern. Soft yellow, pale blue, and blush pink create a delicate color combination inspired by blizzard blue, flavescent, and misty rose. The light, slanted stripes bring a playful yet calming look to nursery projects, baby-themed creations, stationery, and cute seasonal crafts. Its repeating layout makes it easy to use across digital and printable projects that call for a sweet, minimal pastel aesthetic.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n– Summer scrapbook pages and journaling\n– Baby shower invitations and nursery decor\n– Cute wrapping paper and gift packaging\n– Planner stickers and digital paper\n– Fabric prints, quilting, and sewing projects\n– Birthday cards and party decorations\n– Sublimation designs and DIY crafts\n– Phone wallpapers and social media graphics",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a breezy summer touch to your designs with this pastel diagonal stripe seamless pattern. Soft yellow, pale blue, and blush pink create a delicate color combination inspired by blizzard blue, flavescent, and misty rose. The light, slanted stripes bring a playful yet calming look to nursery projects, baby-themed creations, stationery, and cute seasonal crafts. Its repeating layout makes it easy to use across digital and printable projects that call for a sweet, minimal pastel aesthetic.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n• 15 seamless patterns<br>\n• Format: JPEG<br>\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n• High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n– Summer scrapbook pages and journaling<br>\n– Baby shower invitations and nursery decor<br>\n– Cute wrapping paper and gift packaging<br>\n– Planner stickers and digital paper<br>\n– Fabric prints, quilting, and sewing projects<br>\n– Birthday cards and party decorations<br>\n– Sublimation designs and DIY crafts<br>\n– Phone wallpapers and social media graphics</p>",
